<title>LATVIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the main headlines from Latvia's state radio at noon on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- European Commissioner Hans van den Broek arrives in Latvia today from Vilnius to open the new EU office in Riga tomorrow.</p>
<p>- Riga hosts an international conference of judges from 19 central and eastern European countries on the independence of the judiciary.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
